 "caveats": [
  "36 questions and one run on each side: the intervals overlap and do not separate the two runs.",
  "v1 (2 November) and v1.1 (hash published 3 November) were publicly dated before this run; v1.2 was not. v1.2 changed the expected schema of Q1-06..Q1-11 from /4 to /5 after /5 answers had been seen, so those six passes are not independent evidence.",
  "Q1-03 and Q1-15 (Solana) answered 503 on 3 November and 200 on 5 November; Q1-22 and Q1-24 build on the Q1-03 answer (409 on 3 November, 200 on 5 November). Q1-14 (Solana governance) answered 200 on 3 November and 503 on 5 November (error code RPC_RESPONSE_INVALID; no automatic retry; no credit charged; cause not established). These changes are in Solana reads and in questions that build on them; this run does not isolate the effect of any service release.",
  "Q1-27 is a defect of the question itself (its premise is a record that a refused input never creates); it stays a miss and is not corrected after the fact."
 ]
